    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82255" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστεφ-ᾰνόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστέφω</span>
			, <i>encircle</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμὲ ποῖος οὐκ
				ὄχλος π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				787
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
