				4.1725
			</span></i> (Samos, tm.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλὲψ -στεφανοῦσα τὴν
				καρδίαν</span>
			<i>coronary</i> vein, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				6.14
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῖλοι πτεροῖσι περιεστεφανωμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.92
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρεσι περιεστεφάνωται πᾶσα
				Θεσσαλίη</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				130
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>put round in a circle</i>, 
